comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-10T17:37:14.535Z","harness:codex","Implementation begins alongside pm-bbk8we: SDK exportAttestation and verifyAttestation, versioned detached per-stream digests plus deterministic workspace rollup, read-only bare-clone verification, explicit maintenance transition evidence, and thin native history attest command. Existing all-status lineage reused; no duplicate. The trust boundary is an independently retained bundle: local hashes alone cannot authenticate authors or resist replacement of both data and proof."
  "2026-09-10T17:50:14.841Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: SDK exact-byte bundle export and standalone verification pass initial bare-history tests; maintenance integration verifies repair/redaction/compaction transitions. Strict parser rejects malformed summaries even with recomputed rollups. CLI acceptance exposed a parent history --verify boolean collision with child --verify <file>; enabling Commander positional options isolates child flags. Full gates and review are pending."
  "2026-09-10T17:58:44.722Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: CLI export and nested SDK verification passed. Regression test exposed missing hoisting for top-level runAction verify; added action-specific hoisting and rejection of malformed verification arguments. Earlier Commander positional-option hypothesis was disproved; binding the child verify value during bootstrap fixes ancestor boolean parsing without changing global flag behavior. Full coverage and repository ESLint are running."
  "2026-09-10T18:16:57.894Z","harness:codex","Verification progress: 184 focused tests passed, followed by a passing CLI regression that exports all 65 retained streams without default projection, rejects explicit universal output controls, verifies a bare history copy without writes, exercises nested and flat SDK transport arguments, and refuses overwriting an existing proof. Typecheck passed. Initial full coverage run had 8675 passing tests and 16 failures (contract expectations, generated drift and three timeouts); these are being corrected and rerun before closure. No coverage or shipping claim yet."
  "2026-09-10T18:48:20.869Z","harness:codex","Live negative-control finding: a missing attestation proof surfaced as unknown_error/exit 1 instead of an actionable input refusal; Sentry received scrubbed PM-CLI-3B. Existing canonical attestation ownership covers the correction, so no duplicate item is created. TDD reproduction also confirms an existing output file leaks raw EEXIST instead of usage guidance. Add bounded file-input/output diagnostics while preserving exclusive-create semantics and non-overwrite evidence."
  "2026-09-10T18:52:01.137Z","harness:codex","Acceptance evidence: packed artifacts installed and ran under npm/npx and Bun/bunx in separate temporary workspaces; export, changed-history refusal, SHA512 re-export, bare-history-copy verification, legacy CLI alias and public governance SDK all passed. Real repository export covered 2746 streams; backend telemetry recorded matching command_start and successful command_finish with 162709ms duration, and broker ready/unacknowledged queues were zero when checked. Context and 57-surface token budgets, package-first authoring dogfood, packed artifact bound and published-release compatibility passed. Full exact coverage and review still pending."
  "2026-09-10T19:07:47.850Z","harness:codex","Final full-suite evidence: 8697 tests across 665 files passed with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage (64135 statements, 48838 branches, 13331 functions, 61451 lines). Real missing/malformed proof and existing-output cases now return usage exit 2 with actionable guidance, while output remains exclusive and unchanged after refusal. Sentry negative-control PM-CLI-3B confirmed scrubbed error delivery and the live missing-file retry confirms the correction. The stable source-quality provider, grammar, lint, duplication, context budgets and published/packed acceptance gates passed."
  "2026-09-10T19:09:33.480Z","harness:codex","Final sequential linked verification passed both registered commands after removing overlapping builds: SDK/bare-copy/maintenance/CLI acceptance and real Commander operand/output/error boundaries. Final typecheck passed across core, public type tests, packages and examples. Full static pipeline and package-owned changelog are the final pre-PR delivery steps."
  "2026-09-10T19:29:42.668Z","harness:codex","Observability negative control PM-CLI-3B was generated only by this unreleased local proof-file test. The same missing-proof invocation now returns usage exit 2 and a fresh warning log; real regression and full coverage include the fix. The one-event local probe is being resolved in Sentry as repaired test evidence, not as a claim that the new command is already published. Packed npm/npx and Bun/bunx acceptance was repeated successfully after the file UX and telemetry fixes."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
